              "id": "GHSA-7pqw-9j4j-h8q3",
              "shortDescription": {
                 "text": "high severity - GHSA-7pqw-9j4j-h8q3 Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal') vulnerability in pkg:npm\/extract-zip@1.6.7"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "extract-zip through 2.0.1 containment-checks only the parent directory of each archive entry and never the entry's own final path component, so an archive containing two entries with identical names - a symlink whose target is outside the destination, followed by a regular file - writes through the planted symlink and yields an arbitrary file write outside the destination directory."
              },
              "help": {
