            "text": "GHSA-p8p7-x288-28g6 - The `request` package through 2.88.2 for Node.js and the `@cypress\/request` package prior to 3.0.0 allow a bypass of SSRF mitigations via an attacker-controller server that does a cross-protocol redirect (HTTP to HTTPS, or HTTPS to HTTP).\n\nNOTE: The `request` package is no longer supported by the maintainer."
